    <string name="privacy_read">Read the privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_full">StatusHD needs no account. All compression happens on your phone with FFmpeg — your videos and photos are never uploaded anywhere. This app has no ads and does not track you. Your WhatsApp number is only stored on your phone, and only used if you choose “Send to my WhatsApp number”.</string>

